xciting \u2013 a \"MacBook Ultra\" \u2013 positioned above the Pro as Apple's top-tier laptop, suggesting that the current M5 Pro and M5 Max models will remain on sale when it launches.</p><p>The MacBook would be just the latest Apple product to carry the Ultra name, which already spans the Apple Watch Ultra and CarPlay Ultra (not forgetting Apple's top-end Ultra-designated silicon chips). This is likely to bring a markedly higher price point for the new machines.</p><p>It fits into a broader trend at Apple, where the company is seeking to offer more models at more price points, such as the new MacBook Neo at an unprecedented $599 price point. Below, we've listed the features we are expecting in the MacBook Ultra, which is likely to go on sale either later this year or in early 2027.</p><p>As things stand, the latter time frame is now looking more likely, ","1779649367000","system / SharedFunctionInfo / ln","system / SharedFunctionInfo / so","system / SharedFunctionInfo / Kt","system / SharedFunctionInfo / xt","system / SharedFunctionInfo / ra","system / SharedFunctionInfo / dn","system / SharedFunctionInfo / Jt","system / SharedFunctionInfo / ca","system / SharedFunctionInfo / pn","system / SharedFunctionInfo / mn","system / SharedFunctionInfo / la","system / SharedFunctionInfo / nt","system / SharedFunctionInfo / da","system / SharedFunctionInfo / kt","system / SharedFunctionInfo / ot","system / SharedFunctionInfo / Yt","system / SharedFunctionInfo / Qt","system / SharedFunctionInfo / Ve","system / SharedFunctionInfo / pa","system / SharedFunctionInfo / gn","system / SharedFunctionInfo / ma","system / SharedFunctionInfo / Zt","system / SharedFunctionInfo / ua","system / SharedFunctionInfo / hn","system / SharedFunctionInfo / ya","system / SharedFunctionInfo / bn","system / SharedFunctionInfo / va","system / SharedFunctionInfo / Ie","system / SharedFunctionInfo / wn","system / SharedFunctionInfo / ba","system / SharedFunctionInfo / xn","system / SharedFunctionInfo 